WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:02.168 --> 00:00:03.420
Musashi!

00:00:50.050 --> 00:00:51.342
Are you all right?

00:00:51.926 --> 00:00:53.887
That's the Oni Gauntlet…

00:00:53.970 --> 00:00:54.804
What?

00:00:56.056 --> 00:00:59.809
It's the legendary gauntlet
that seals the Oni's power.

00:01:00.393 --> 00:01:05.774
It defeats monsters and sucks their souls
to gain more strength.

00:01:06.816 --> 00:01:09.027
Oni… gauntlet?

00:01:10.070 --> 00:01:12.989
I only heard about it.

00:01:13.073 --> 00:01:15.533
This is the first time I've seen it.

